Certificate data in certs/cacrt_all.pem and certs/cacrt_deprecated.pem is
extracted from Mozilla's NSS root certificate store (certdata.txt) via the
curl project's mk-ca-bundle tooling and is distributed under the terms of the
Mozilla Public License, v. 2.0 (https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/).

